nt"],[["2024/10/06，最愛擔擔麵，韭菜水餃也不錯吃，肥嫩叉燒超讚\n2024/01/14，大阪肉肉超推薦，擔擔麵跟蒜蓉香蔥拉麵也超愛\n2023/02/28，拉麵超推，搭配水餃很讚，但叉燒飯味道不夠，麥仔紅茶好喝，店面跟菜單都更新了，略微漲價但還是很划算，麵的軟硬度可調整，水是自取自助的\n2020年，超愛這家拉麵~很有味道卻不死鹹，店家提供的是細麵條，可選偏硬，口感跟日本一樣道地，黃金半熟蛋也超搭，而且是一整顆~最愛擔擔叉燒跟蒜蓉香蔥，都是以濃郁豚骨湯為基底，非常推薦!價位$110~220，超佛心",null,[0,142]]]],[null,1704980211000000,1704980211000000,"2 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQm04RUE1SVBwek5sbi03ekFBbF9Gdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQm04RUE1SVBwek5sbi03ekFBbF9GdxoTQ2d3STg5M19yQVlRODlYaHFBSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjAmu-owtKWAxVQhq8BHS0uBFMQ_2MIyQIoJw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/716550025998383581/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk5helkzTURsM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/716550025998383581/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk5helkzTURsM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/716550025998383581/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk5helkzTURsM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/716550025998383581/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk5helkzTURsM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/716550025998383581/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk5helkzTURsM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/716550025998383581/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk5helkzTURsM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["真不愧是在地嚮導！",null,[0,9]]]],[null,null,6715,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNNazY3MDl3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa46209073b1f7452!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICMk6709wE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNNazY3MDl3RRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNNazY3MDl3RRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNNaz